akasta sai myydä yhdessä vaaleaorakkaan kanssa, ja tämä ajatus on säilytetty Ruokaviraston ohjeessa. On myös esitetty luokituksia, joissa aiemmin yhtenä lajina pidetystä rusko-orakkaasta on erotettu omiksi lajeikseen mm. simaorakas (<i>Hydnum umbilicatum</i>) ja ryväsorakas (<i>Hydnum ellipsosporum</i>). Rusko-orakas muistuttaa vaaleaorakasta, mutta sen väri on ruskeankellertävä. Sen lakin väri vaihtelee","spread":21401,"m":[0,0,0,0,0,0,4,8,12,3,0,0],"s":[[61.27553,24.70532],[61.47764,23.9377],[61.50434,23.8421],[61.28351,24.00227],[61.45216,23.75248],[61.38569,24.51245]]},{"id":127431,"sci":"Emmelina monodactyla","fi":"Kiertosulkanen","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/189904375/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/189904375/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Ian Wright, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Ian Wright","wiki":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emmelina_monodactyla","summary":"","spread":24625,"m":[0,0,0,1,6,4,2,10,8,2,2,0],"s":[[61.43921,23.85001],[61.45491,24.11103],[61.45527,24.11],[61.45527,24.11],[61.45492,24.11083],[61.49555,23.80961],[61.4548,24.11068],[61.31178,22.87954],[61.45491,24.11063],[61.45494,24.11085],[61.45492,24.11066],[61.04112,23.47047],[61.47159,23.83519],[61.52229,24.01292],[61.45494,24.11083],[61.31178,22.87954],[61.4641,23.5324]]},{"id":461937,"sci":"Amphipyra pyramidea","fi":"Hohtopensasyökkönen","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/70390834/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/70390834/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Pavel Vojtek, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Pavel Vojtek","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hohtopensasyökkönen","summary":"<b>Hohtopensasyökkönen</b> (<i>Amphipyra pyramidea</i>) on eteläisessä Suomessa jokseenkin yleinen loppukesän ja alkusyksyn yöperhoslaji.","spread":28237,"m":[0,0,0,0,1,1,1,27,7,1,0,0],"s":[[61.4957